1. microKanren

   Files:   miniKanren/amb/trs1/base.rkt, miniKanren/amb/demo/main.rkt

   Source:  Jason Hemann and Daniel P. Friedman, "μKanren: A Minimal
            Functional Core for Relational Programming" (Scheme
            Workshop 2013), and https://github.com/jasonhemann/microKanren

   The definitions of walk, unify, the binary disj and conj, the
   Zzz-style delay, conj+ and disj+, and reification are adapted from
   microKanren, with streams replaced by amb, named variables instead of
