4. Tests

   The tests in miniKanren/amb/{trs1,trs2,demo}/tests/ load the
   examples from The Reasoned Schemer (first and second editions) from
   the miniKanren-typed package (typed/miniKanren/trs1/tests/ and
   typed/miniKanren/trs2/tests/); they are not copied into this
   package.  See the NOTICE file of miniKanren-typed.
